{"about_the_game":"Block Trucks is a competitive, real time, ranked multiplayer racing game. <br>Race against opponents on a variety of challenging track surfaces, upgrade your truck and rank up as you win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB THE RANKS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967080/extras/8aaee207b9ebe846ebda16021e9ab4f6.avif?t=1747088260\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br>Start in BRONZE and climb the ranks as you win races. Do you have what it takes to ascend to the esteemed rank of GRAND CHAMPION?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVERSE UPGRADE SYSTEM</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967080/extras/8e20bf5cd526c558b30e4da727ca0277.avif?t=1747088260\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br>Upgrade your truck across 9 different categories to suit your racing strategy. Do you get physical and bump opponents into the barriers, or rely on raw nitro boost and engine upgrades to speed your way to victory?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TOUGH RACING CONDITIONS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967080/extras/4967c501bb7831fbab660ed09938f3fc.avif?t=1747088260\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br>Unlock challening racing conditions as you progress. Start on tarmac where grip is plenty, then slide onto sand, trawl through mud and slippery snow with each track surface testing your racing skills to the limit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL AERIAL CONTROL</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967080/extras/67210e4988853a33bef4b5090bc04940.avif?t=1747088260\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br>Execute aerial control on any axis with back flips, front flips, air roll and spins for show or line up your truck to make perfect landings 